                },
                {
                    "row": 1,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.1 Remarks on the accompanying documentation (none, or give comments): 1. The original documents for the delivered products in paper form in Russian and English have not been provided in accordance with clause 5.1.2 of Technical Specification No. 1312-ARE-2025-PR-amendments. 1 Appendix No. 2 to Contract No. 039/35930-D dated July 28, 2025/Не предоставлены оригиналы документов на поставленную продукцию в бумажном виде на русском и английском языках согласно пункту 5.1.2 Технического задания №1312-АРЕ-2025-ПР-изм.1 Приложение №2 к Договору № 039/35930-Д от 28.07.2025.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 2,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.2. Remarks for visual, measurement and other inspections including Materials completeness (none, or give comments):1. A visual inspection revealed that the delivered products did not comply with the specifications of Contract No. 039/35930-D dated July 28, 2025 (hereinafter referred to as the Specifications): EURO white Tikkivala paint was actually delivered, while according to the requirements of item No. 6 of the Specification, EURO 2 white Tikkivala paint should have been delivered/При визуальном осмотре выявлено несоответствии поставленной продукции спецификации Договора № 039/35930-Д от 28.07.2025 (далее – Спецификация): фактически поставлена Краска EURO белая Tikkivala, согласно требованиям п/п №6 Спецификации должна быть поставлена Краска EURO 2 белая Tikkivala.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 3,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.3. Remarks for preservation and/or anticorrosive coating (none, or give comments): NONE",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 4,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.4. Nonconformities (none, or give comments, Nonconformity Report no.): NONE",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
